  "body": "Found in the read of PR #3387 after its merge (fdda55e15).\n\n1. `docs/decisions/3356-face-pass-start.md:51-59` (\"Review repair, 2026-11-22\") describes the repair of the planner of #3353 and commits of the post dialog. It does not belong to #3356. The cut gathers this file into `RECOMMENDED.md`. Remove the paragraph before the next cut.\n2. A project file that has a `pass_start` key on a Face operation (written by hand) loads with no message, and the key is dropped (`OpParams` does not refuse unknown fields). Face does not write that key. Add a test that pins the behaviour, or give a note on load.\n3. `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill2d_page.rs` has 410 lines (408 before). Split it along the domain seam.\n4. The body of PR #3387 had the line `Process change: yes` with no process file in its diff. No `PROCESS_VERSION` bump is necessary for it.\n",
